JetSetRadioFuture-Unleashed (MIT)
---------------------------------

  https://github.com/JuMatt/JetSetRadioFuture-Unleashed

  jsrf_recomp/src/recomp_manual.c, "the camera on the right stick" (v265
  onwards): the hooks on the game's camera (its update and publication),
  turning the eye and the heading and putting them back, the stick's dead
  zone and response curve, the turning speeds and limits, and the rotation
  maths are adapted from its port/recomp_manual.c. The behaviour (turning
  while standing still, easing back on setting off, the timings), the
  settings and the way the stick is read are this project's.

